      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mt-8">
        <div class="bg-[#141414] border border-white/10 rounded-[16px] p-4 text-center"><div class="text-xl font-bold text-white">50k+</div><div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.15em] text-white/40">READERS</div></div>
        <div class="bg-[#141414] border border-white/10 rounded-[16px] p-4 text-center"><div class="text-xl font-bold text-[#FFB800]">4.9★</div><div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.15em] text-white/40">2,400 REVIEWS</div></div>
        <div class="bg-[#141414] border border-white/10 rounded-[16px] p-4 text-center"><div class="text-xl font-bold text-white">10s</div><div class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.15em] text-white/40">DELIVERY</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="lg:col-span-7">
      <div class="bg-[#141414] border border-white/10 rounded-[20px] overflow-hidden">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512820790803-83ca734da794?w=900&h=600&fit=crop" alt="Mavizio Store" class="w-full h-[320px] object-cover">
        <div class="p-6">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-white">Why digital?</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-white/60 leading-relaxed mt-2">No waiting for courier. Pay via UPI/Razorpay, get PDF+EPUB+MOBI + audio summary on email & WhatsApp in 10 seconds. Re-download anytime. GST invoice included. 30-day refund — no questions.</p>
          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="text-xs bg-[#FFB800] text-black px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-bold">Razorpay Secure</span>
            <span class="text-xs bg-white/5 border border-white/10 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full">UPI • Cards • Netbanking</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-10 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-[20px] p-6 sm:p-8">
    <div class="text-xs tracking-[0.18em] text-white/40">WHAT YOU GET</div>
    <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-4 text-sm">
      <span class="flex gap-2 items-center text-white/80"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill text-[#FFB800]"></i> PDF + EPUB + MOBI + Audio summary</span>
      <span class="flex gap-2 items-center text-white/80"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill text-[#FFB800]"></i> Lifetime free updates</span>
      <span class="flex gap-2 items-center text-white/80"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill text-[#FFB800]"></i> Works on phone, Kindle, laptop</span>
      <span class="flex gap-2 items-center text-white/80"><i class="ri-checkbox-circle-fill text-[#FFB800]"></i> 30-day money-back guarantee</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mt-8 prose prose-invert max-w-none prose-p:text-white/60 prose-headings:text-white">
    {{ page.content }}
  </div>
</div>
